Package: iQualityR.sampling
Title: Sampling Plan Analysis for iQualityR
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Provides sampling plan analysis tools, including attribute
  sampling plans (single, double, multiple), operating characteristic (OC)
  curves, power analysis, producer's and consumer's risk evaluation,
  average sample number (ASN) curves, and related visualizations and
  reporting, consistent with the iQualityR ecosystem.
